    - target: {fileID: 3539757102279911050, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Size.z
      value: 2.99
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.size
      value: 19
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[0].Text
      value: Hmm? Who goes there?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[1].Text
      value: MEOW!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[2].Text
      value: You're not getting the jump on us this time!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[3].Text
      value: Wait! Stop!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[4].Text
      value: Stop? After your friends ambushed us? I don't think so.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[5].Text
      value: You were the ones that stole our cheese first!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[6].Text
      value: Your cheese, meow? We never stole any cheese.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[7].Text
      value: Don't listen to them , they're just trying to throw us off.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[8].Text
      value: I think there might be a misunderstanding. We didn't steal any cheese.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[9].Text
      value: Are you not the cheese thieves? Goudaness me... I'm so sorry we misunderstood!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[10].Text
      value: Recently someone stole all of our cheese, we've been a tad on edge.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[11].Text
      value: So... Are we not going to fight them?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[12].Text
      value: We shouldn't fight if we can be friends instead, meow!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[13].Text
      value: "We're not thieves, simply wandering travellers making our way. We\u2019re
        in search of a quest if you need any assistance with your thief issue."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[14].Text
      value: "A quest you say? Well, if you aren\u2019t thieves, there\u2019s no
        need to fight anymore. In fact, I\u2019m sure our mayor would love to speak
        with you."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[15].Text
      value: What do you guys think? Should we talk to the mayor?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[16].Text
      value: I guess we could, meow!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[17].Text
      value: "This feels like a trap. Aren\u2019t you mad that we hurt your friends?
        Don\u2019t you want to avenge them?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[18].Text
      value: Oh, nah... No one liked those two.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7455643174133851167, guid: 59ddeb0ee22ab534bb4005d34b558143,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[0].Character
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7d2a914e6fb60d64e91eaaf01088cae8,
        type: 2}
